WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.818
[Warm, Reassuring Rock Ballad Intro]

00:00:20.818 --> 00:00:27.500
You learned to live in shifting sands

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.500
With no safe place to ever land

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.500
You learned that doors could slam and lock

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:41.138
Against the ticking of the clock

00:00:41.158 --> 00:00:45.000
You learned that touch could be a cage

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.500
A quiet, simmering, bitter rage

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.872
But that old world is dead and gone

00:00:52.892 --> 00:00:56.800
It's time to face a brand new dawn

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.200
So let my arms be your new walls

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:04.042
To catch you every time you fall

00:01:04.062 --> 00:01:07.800
This house stands, it will not break

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.500
For your own precious, gentle sake

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.268
If it's a hug that you should need

00:01:15.328 --> 00:01:19.200
A simple, pure, and loving creed

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:22.551
Then I am here, my love is true

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:30.362
My arms will be a home for you

00:01:30.362 --> 00:01:53.058
[Clean, Melodic, Triumphant Electric Guitar Solo]

00:01:53.058 --> 00:01:56.800
No need to brace, no need to hide

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:01.000
With your two sisters by your side

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:06.500
We'll be the lock, we'll be the key

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:10.808
To your own safe reality

00:02:10.928 --> 00:02:14.200
We'll be the roof against the rain

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.912
To wash away the hurt and pain

00:02:17.112 --> 00:02:20.354
This is a vow we'll always keep

00:02:24.072 --> 00:02:29.488
While you are in your troubled sleep

00:02:29.488 --> 00:02:39.880
[Final Sustained Chord Resolving into Silence]
